index(structure, analog, grammar)

	* Structure: self-similar, relation-first, locally autonomous, gated integration
	* Analog: CRDT + typed module graph
	* Grammar: lattice state, idempotent ops, typed interfaces, emergent convergence, integration-as-proof

Search efficiency on the next run: any problem involving distributed coherence, speculative states, or emergent consistency maps directly here.


